[center][size=5][b]Fields of Mistria Vortex Support[/b][/size][/center]

This Vortex extension adds Fields of Mistria support through [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/fieldsofmistria/mods/949]AIM - Alternative Installer for Mistria[/url].

[b]What it does[/b]
[list]
[*]Detects the Steam installation of Fields of Mistria.
[*]Uses the game's [code]mods[/code] folder as Vortex's mod staging target.
[*]Offers to download the current AIM CLI when it is missing.
[*]Runs AIM after Vortex deploys mods for a Fields of Mistria profile.
[/list]

[b]Requirements[/b]
[list]
[*]Vortex on Windows.
[*]Fields of Mistria installed through Steam.
[*]A current AIM release. The extension can download its CLI automatically.
[/list]

[b]Installation[/b]
Install this extension through Vortex's Extensions page, then select Fields of Mistria. If AIM is not already available, use the Download action shown by Vortex. Deploying mods then asks AIM to install them into the game.

[b]Notes[/b]
This is a Vortex integration for AIM, not a replacement for AIM's own mod-management tools. Report extension problems on this page with the Vortex version, AIM version, and relevant log details.
